pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="request-WEB:1f281149-2364-4610-b4cf-e5608bd0535c-14" data-testid="conversation-turn-30" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant" style=""><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT sade:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="a16f44ee-e04d-4894-b531-0fbbdb7de742" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="202">Perfekcyjnie, Arkadiuszu 👏<br data-start="27" data-end="30">
To zdjęcie <strong data-start="41" data-end="71">„imagesteam_arkadiusz.jpg”</strong> wygląda genialnie — klimat dokładnie taki, o jaki chodziło: naturalny, przyjazny, z Tobą i zespołem na tle <strong data-start="179" data-end="199">Sött och Elegant</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="204" data-end="324">📂 Teraz zapisz je w folderze projektu w podfolderze <code data-start="257" data-end="266">images/</code> i zmień nazwę dokładnie na:<br data-start="294" data-end="297">
👉 <strong data-start="300" data-end="324"><code data-start="302" data-end="322">team_arkadiusz.jpg</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="326" data-end="443">Dzięki temu będzie się automatycznie wczytywać w podstronie <strong data-start="386" data-end="403"><code data-start="388" data-end="401">om_oss.html</code></strong>, bo tam właśnie do niej się odwołujemy.</p>
<hr data-start="445" data-end="448">
<p data-start="450" data-end="472">✅ <strong data-start="452" data-end="472">Co robimy dalej:</strong></p>
<ol data-start="473" data-end="757">
<li data-start="473" data-end="554">
<p data-start="476" data-end="554">Strona <code data-start="483" data-end="496">om_oss.html</code> jest już gotowa (wraz z <code data-start="521" data-end="533">index.html</code> i <code data-start="536" data-end="552">produkter.html</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="555" data-end="757">
<p data-start="558" data-end="585">Kolejny etap to stworzenie:</p>
<ul data-start="589" data-end="757">
<li data-start="589" data-end="691">
<p data-start="591" data-end="691"><strong data-start="591" data-end="609"><code data-start="593" data-end="607">galleri.html</code></strong> – galeria wszystkich wypieków (użyjemy zdjęć, które już mi wcześniej przesłałeś),</p>
</li>
<li data-start="695" data-end="757">
<p data-start="697" data-end="757"><strong data-start="697" data-end="715"><code data-start="699" data-end="713">kontakt.html</code></strong> – formularz kontaktowy z Twoimi danymi.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="759" data-end="857" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Chcesz, żebym teraz przygotował kod galerii (<code data-start="804" data-end="818">galleri.html</code> + sekcja CSS w stylu reszty projektu)?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Kopiera" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3