  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">&lt;!-- 🇸🇪 Sidans titel / 🇵🇱 Tytuł strony --&gt;</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">title</span></span></span><span>&gt;Sött och Elegant – Konditori i Dalarna</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">title</span></span></span><span>&gt;

  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">&lt;!-- 🇸🇪 Metadata för sökmotorer / 🇵🇱 Dane SEO dla wyszukiwarek --&gt;</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">meta</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">name</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"description"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">content</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Sött och Elegant – ett svenskt konditori i Dalarna. Handgjorda tårtor, cupcakes och klassiska svenska bakverk skapade med hjärta och passion."</span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">meta</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">name</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"keywords"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">content</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Sött och Elegant, konditori, tårtor, bakverk, cupcakes, Dalarna, Sverige, Arkadiusz Tokarczyk"</span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">meta</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">name</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"author"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">content</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Arkadiusz Tokarczyk"</span></span><span>&gt;

  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">&lt;!-- 🇸🇪 Favicon / 🇵🇱 Ikona strony --&gt;</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">link</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">rel</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"icon"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">type</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"image/png"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">href</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"images/favicon.png"</span></span><span>&gt;

  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">&lt;!-- 🇸🇪 Open Graph för delning / 🇵🇱 Meta do podglądu na Facebooku i GitHub Pages --&gt;</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">meta</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">property</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"og:title"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">content</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Sött och Elegant – Konditori i Dalarna"</span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">meta</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">property</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"og:description"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">content</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Handgjorda svenska bakverk – varje smak är en känsla."</span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">meta</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">property</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"og:image"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">content</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"https://yourgithubusername.github.io/SottOchElegant/images/team_arkadiusz.jpg"</span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">meta</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">property</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"og:type"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">content</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"website"</span></span><span>&gt;

  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">&lt;!-- 🇸🇪 Länk till CSS / 🇵🇱 Łącze do arkusza stylów --&gt;</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">link</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">rel</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"stylesheet"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">href</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"css/style.css"</span></span><span>&gt;
</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">head</span></span></span><span>&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1947" data-end="2052"><em data-start="1947" data-end="2052">(adres GitHub podmienimy, gdy wrzucisz projekt do repozytorium — wtedy uzupełnimy <code data-start="2030" data-end="2050">yourgithubusername</code>)</em></p>
<hr data-start="2054" data-end="2057">
<h2 data-start="2059" data-end="2113">🧁 2. Favicon – „złota babeczka” w pastelowym stylu</h2>
<p data-start="2115" data-end="2254">To mała ikona, która pojawi się w zakładce przeglądarki.<br data-start="2171" data-end="2174">
Zrobiłem minimalistyczny projekt: złota babeczka w stylu logo.<br data-start="2236" data-end="2239">
Zapisz ją jako:</p>
<p data-start="2256" data-end="2276">📄 <strong data-start="2259" data-end="2276"><code data-start="2261" data-end="2274">favicon.png</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="2278" data-end="2324">i umieść w folderze:<br data-start="2298" data-end="2301">
👉 <code data-start="2304" data-end="2324">images/favicon.png</code></p>
<hr data-start="2326" data-end="2329">
<h2 data-start="2331" data-end="2393">🎨 3. Drobne poprawki w <code data-start="2358" data-end="2369">style.css</code> (globalny wygląd i SEO)</h2>
